{
  "description": "Page Browserbase's list operations, which the converter's detection does not recognise. Cursor lists (agents, runs, function secrets, labels, secrets, webhooks) take `cursor` and return `nextCursor` (\"Cursor for the next page. Null when there are no more results.\") beside `data`. Offset lists (downloads, functions, builds, versions, invocations) take `offset`/`limit` and return `total` beside the items. Run messages take `since` and return `nextSince`, the id of the last message returned, which pages like a cursor. All read off the spec's parameter and response descriptions.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.browserbase#AgentsList/traits/smithy.api#paginated",
      "value": {
        "mode": "cursor",
        "inputToken": "cursor",
        "outputToken": "nextCursor",
        "items": "data",
        "pageSize": "limit"
      }
    },
    {
